control holdround (a playoff press is never held (the hold asks only for the next week)): vitest exit 1; 3 red, 66 green of 69
control recapnow (the recap is drawn while he watches the title game): vitest exit 1; 2 red, 67 green of 69
control bracketgrid (the league grid is drawn in the bracket): vitest exit 1; 1 red, 68 green of 69
control tiegame ("Your game" opens his last game and not the game of that tie): vitest exit 1; 1 red, 68 green of 69
control trustspoils (the owner card shows the trust the title game's press graded while he watches it): vitest exit 1; 1 red, 68 green of 69
