control hurtweeks (a man hurt on "Play Week 17" is out a count of weeks in the feed, though nobody heals in the bracket): vitest exit 1; 1 red, 68 green of 69
control donenow (the finish is recorded at the title game's press while he watches it): vitest exit 1; 1 red, 68 green of 69
